`src/voxpipe/format.py` and `src/voxpipe/merge.py` are
adapted from the upstream `transcriber` project (faster-whisper + pyannote),
which declares itself MIT-licensed in its own `pyproject.toml`; it ships no
LICENSE file and names no copyright holder. `src/voxpipe/api.py`
follows the same endpoint and JSON contract.

Pre-trained model weights are NOT covered by this license. See
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md for the licenses and copyright holders of the models
vendored under `vendor/models/`.
